@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Liberation Serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
hide empty members
participant "Worker" as P0
participant "PostgreSQL" as P1
participant "Docker" as P2
participant "GitHub" as P3
P0 -> P1: ClaimDestruction khi qua deadline
P1 -> P0: DESTROYING hoặc không có row
P0 -> P2: Destroy(ResourceGroup)
P2 -> P0: đã dọn đúng ownership
P0 -> P1: Save DESTROYED + pending=true
P0 -> P1: FindPendingDestructionNotices
P0 -> P3: Comment dọn xong
P3 -> P0: thành công
P0 -> P1: ConfirmDestructionNotice
@enduml